WEBVTT

link
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
[Upbeat music and audio demos]
An X link. Your sticker.
Paste an X link and import its video.

animation
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.200
Make it move.
Trim your moment into an animated sticker.

original
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Original sound.
Keep the video’s original sound.

sources
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Add your sound.
Add a file, a link or your microphone.

excerpt
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.200
Pick your excerpt.
Drag to choose the audio excerpt.

sequence
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.400
One after another.
Sound 2 follows sound 1.

mix
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.800
Listen.
Hear the typing, then the added sound.

done
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.400
Your sticker. With sound.
One animation, two sounds, your result.

export
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.400
Save it.
Save the result on your device.

whatsapp
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.400
Straight to WhatsApp.
Tap Receive on WhatsApp, then Send: your sticker arrives in the chat.

outro
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.000
Your turn.
Create your sticker on Zapstick.
